{"compiler":{"version":"0.8.26+commit.8a97fa7a"},"language":"Solidity","output":{"abi":[{"inputs":[{"internalType":"uint256","name":"marketId_","type":"uint256"}],"stateMutability":"nonpayable","type":"constructor"},{"inputs":[],"name":"InvalidMarketId","type":"error"},{"inputs":[],"name":"MARKET_ID","outputs":[{"internalType":"uint256","name":"","type":"uint256"}],"stateMutability":"view","type":"function"},{"inputs":[],"name":"balanceOf","outputs":[{"internalType":"uint256","name":"","type":"uint256"}],"stateMutability":"view","type":"function"}],"devdoc":{"details":"Substrates in this fuse are the address registries of Liquity protocol that are used in the Liquity protocol for a given MARKET_ID","kind":"dev","methods":{"balanceOf()":{"returns":{"_0":"The total balance of the Plasma Vault in USD (scaled to 18 decimals, that are the BOLD decimals)."}}},"title":"Fuse for Liquity protocol responsible for calculating the balance of the Plasma Vault in Liquity protocol based on preconfigured market substrates","version":1},"userdoc":{"kind":"user","methods":{"balanceOf()":{"notice":"Calculates the USD-denominated balance of the Plasma Vault in the Liquity protocol.         The balance includes:         - Current BOLD deposits (compounded after liquidations)         - Stashed collateral (claimed but not sent)         - Unrealized collateral gains from liquidations         - Unrealized BOLD yield gains from interest         It is assumed that BOLD token is the same across all registries"}},"version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"lib/ipor-fusion/contracts/fuses/liquity/LiquityBalanceFuse.sol":"LiquityBalanceFuse"},"evmVersion":"cancun","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":1000000},"remappings":[":@chainlink/=lib/ipor-fusion/node_modules/@chainlink/",":@ensdomains/=node_modules/@ensdomains/",":@eth-optimism/=lib/ipor-fusion/node_modules/@eth-optimism/",":@ethereum-vault-connector/=lib/ipor-fusion/node_modules/ethereum